write volume nobody could have simulated cheaply beforehand. She's right and
everyone in the room knew it, but it's never fun watching someone defend work that
went wrong through no real fault of theirs.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '30 days' + interval '16 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('a1429c50-b154-494b-aeca-3ade2e5fd349', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Mum's follow-up scan is booked for a couple of weeks from now, just to double check the bloods thing. Also: three nights running now of properly good sleep. Cautiously calling the caffeine thing a genuine change and not a fluke.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '30 days' + interval '19 hours 40 minutes', NULL),
  ('037b9a58-9de6-455e-94a2-679c59837a3e', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Someone booked over my desk booth again despite the calendar clearly showing it taken. Small thing, disproportionately annoying.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '29 days' + interval '13 hours 50 minutes', NULL),
  ('bfeabeef-3800-49b8-808a-997086eb5b0a', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Rain again. Ordered in, watched something forgettable, in bed early.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '29 days' + interval '22 hours 15 minutes', NULL),
  ('4f67d85f-03ef-403c-8a8a-523b47cefad9', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Got impatient and tried a short jog before Anya technically cleared it. Knee twinged about ten minutes in, same spot as before. Furious with myself, mostly because I knew better and did it anyway.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '28 days' + interval '8 hours 20 minutes', NULL),
  ('c6bb9739-cc07-4152-8217-9289c77bb4e8', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Iced the knee, sulked about the jog thing, ate crisps for dinner out of spite at my own body. Going to actually wait for the green light next time. Probably.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '28 days' + interval '21 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('dd38d14b-2b2d-4707-8bf5-dd61085ca75a', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Devika's back-of-envelope estimate for Aurora's next cutover attempt is 'soon, but not this soon' which is not the confidence-inspiring update anyone wanted, but at least it's honest.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '26 days' + interval '12 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('7b8026c9-1c98-4608-bafe-3cdb303f76d8', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Flat viewing fell through because the other applicant moved faster. Slightly deflating but the one from a few weeks back is still holding, so not a disaster.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '26 days' + interval '22 hours 50 minutes', NULL),
  ('2edefd21-0386-4e93-b847-adf1c1787b84', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Signed the lease on the new flat this morning. It's official, keys handed over in about two weeks. Landlord seems normal, the flat has actual working heating in every room which after the last place feels borderline luxurious.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '25 days' + interval '11 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('bf8b1a25-396a-4a23-aa34-2827a72e536f', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Getting ready for Priya's hen do. Curled my hair badly, laughed about it, has already started. She's had two prosecco and is telling everyone the flower story again.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '25 days' + interval '19 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('1dae1843-60fd-438e-9d2f-46390c8ae14f', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Home. Feet destroyed, mascara somewhere near my ears, had an genuinely great night. Priya cried happy-crying twice which set the whole table off. Water, painkillers, bed, in that order, self-administered like a professional.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '25 days' + interval '23 hours 50 minutes', NULL),
  ('5a7370ae-7ce0-4cc4-b6d9-a7db4abc2519', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Hungover in a way that feels almost nostalgic, like my body remembers this from years ago and isn't thrilled to be doing it again. Toast, water, more water.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '24 days' + interval '10 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('d93b0f97-655f-405e-bf36-629cfe9aa295', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Recovered enough to be a functioning human by dinner. Watched something undemanding. Knee's fine, at least that's not also hurting today.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '24 days' + interval '21 hours 20 minutes', NULL),
  ('d5423f4a-aa09-4d21-8971-41856c12b4f1', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Back to work, back to the same three Slack channels arguing about the same thing. The circle of life.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '23 days' + interval '13 hours 10 minutes', NULL),
  ('41eaaefe-78fd-49df-a82c-e1018d8b32d4', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Did the physio exercises, cycled a bit on the stationary bike, felt genuinely good afterwards. Starting to remember what having a functioning leg feels like.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '23 days' + interval '22 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('85e9c41f-8bfc-43d6-b737-9a3286be8e8b', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Aurora's back on a firmer footing — new plan breaks the remaining tables into smaller batches so a failure doesn't take down the whole cutover next time. Devika seems more like herself again, less of the tight jaw she's had for weeks.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '22 days' + interval '17 hours 40 minutes', NULL),
  ('befd9fd7-97c7-48e8-abbd-2fc22c18be12', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Mum's scan is in a couple of days. Trying not to think about it too much but obviously thinking about it constantly. Distracted myself with Lessons in Chemistry, which is helping, it's very funny in a way I didn't expect.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '22 days' + interval '22 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('fb18121a-a598-4b78-81ad-8c177c5618be', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Mum's scan results are back — all clear, nothing to worry about, doctor's happy, back to normal yearly check-ups. Actually got a bit emotional on the phone with her, she just laughed and said she told me it was nothing. She probably did tell me that. I didn't believe her, that's the whole problem.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '20 days' + interval '12 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('23fca809-8963-4835-8240-2fb3e35aa774', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Anya cleared me for light jogging, short distances, flat ground only for now. Also had a coffee at half three because it's been a week and I felt I'd earned it. The knee news is the bigger win today by a distance.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '20 days' + interval '20 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('4580dc50-a0cc-48d7-8595-fbebdcd1d30c', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$First jog since the ban lifted, kept it to fifteen minutes on the flat bit by the canal. Slow, careful, genuinely thrilling in a way that fifteen slow minutes has no right to be.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '19 days' + interval '9 hours 40 minutes', NULL),
  ('54f7ae7d-0a4d-4d9a-a326-b32af35bef83', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Uneventful evening. Reading, tea, the usual.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '19 days' + interval '22 hours 10 minutes', NULL),
  ('ba9838d5-456f-470d-a97b-e30ef4a72587', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Work thing dragged on all afternoon, nothing worth writing down really.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '18 days' + interval '13 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('a5782652-d4b8-4b6a-9dc3-2c7dcf9accf7', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '18 days' + interval '21 hours 0 minutes', date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '13 days' + interval '9 hours 10 minutes'),
  ('dd95b141-9940-48e1-b9ea-bfe17f3b49c3', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Booked the travel for the wedding — train down, staying at the little B&B near the venue with two of the other bridesmaids. Also had the final dress fitting, only needed a tiny adjustment this time.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '17 days' + interval '18 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('2707f243-2378-4177-84a6-fb78ae632a0b', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Packed a bag for the move even though it's still a couple of weeks off, mostly because looking at boxes makes the whole thing feel more real and slightly less terrifying.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '17 days' + interval '22 hours 40 minutes', NULL),
  ('09bcd26b-5911-4e69-8987-0bd55c193231', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Devika's aiming for the Aurora cutover again next week, smaller batch this time, more monitoring in place. Nervous energy in the team channel today, understandably.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '16 days' + interval '12 hours 20 minutes', NULL),
  ('23981b10-e847-43a6-80c3-9ba40c35be73', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Tired. Long one. Bed.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '16 days' + interval '23 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('7a1a1a6c-a182-49cd-85ad-98aa08ec80af', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Started packing properly today, not just the trial box from a few weeks ago. Turns out I own an alarming number of mugs. Found one from a work leaving do in 2019, no idea who that was for anymore.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '15 days' + interval '10 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('67e24170-fe66-4469-b41b-2f5e748a6bd2', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Halfway through Lessons in Chemistry now, the rowing club chapter got me properly laughing on the train, actually out loud, got a look from the guy across the aisle.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '15 days' + interval '20 hours 15 minutes', NULL),
  ('47302848-dd43-475c-a0ca-75635cf3b9bf', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Exhausted from packing. Everything hurts that isn't even the knee, which is a novel kind of ache. Ordered food because cooking felt like one task too many today.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '15 days' + interval '22 hours 45 minutes', NULL),
  ('a738b6ef-739d-48b2-a866-dff1db6380be', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Another packing morning before work. The kitchen boxes are somehow already heavier than everything else combined.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '14 days' + interval '9 hours 20 minutes', NULL),
  ('f76a8480-9a07-4d40-bcec-77629da9182c', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Aurora cutover is tomorrow, the rescheduled one. Devika sent a very calm message to the team tonight that I suspect took real effort to sound that calm.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '14 days' + interval '21 hours 50 minutes', NULL),
  ('e941d902-8684-4856-99bb-79b76561f842', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Aurora cutover happened this morning and, remarkably, went fine. Smaller batches, better monitoring, no drama. Devika's message in the channel afterwards was just a single relieved emoji, which said more than a paragraph would have.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '13 days' + interval '13 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('c9c6811d-9a0e-4a1a-b9c6-3fd47fea03bf', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Celebrated the successful cutover with, embarrassingly, an early night. Priorities.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '13 days' + interval '22 hours 20 minutes', NULL),
  ('7160c7c7-bbdb-4591-a78a-5a0a41d3d26f', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$First proper run back — a full thirty minutes, actual pace, not just a careful shuffle by the canal. Knee held up completely. Nearly cried a bit at the end, which is a strange thing to admit about a Tuesday morning jog, but there it is.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '12 days' + interval '8 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('3f034620-054c-4c14-8bdd-88d493f42dd6', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Still buzzing slightly from the run this morning. Told Anya at today's check-in and she just said 'told you' in the most satisfied voice imaginable. Fair enough, she did tell me.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '12 days' + interval '21 hours 10 minutes', NULL),
  ('b7517823-f1b3-456d-96d9-687f4e04a474', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Ordinary work day. Wrote some code, deleted more code than I wrote, called it progress.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '11 days' + interval '12 hours 45 minutes', NULL),
  ('7448f642-5560-47e5-b39b-fa96e38a2eb5', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Packing again. The books box situation has become genuinely embarrassing.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '11 days' + interval '22 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('76e608b2-fc56-4876-ab76-84360ebd1547', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Two months in on the no-caffeine-after-2pm thing and I'm calling it: real improvement. Falling asleep faster, waking up less through the night, and the tea has stopped feeling like a punishment. Not going back to the old way even once the move chaos settles.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '10 days' + interval '19 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('5cf0bf5f-851b-4fd2-8118-ea2adba77ad5', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Packing marathon this evening. Kitchen's basically done, living room is a warzone of half-filled boxes and things I can't decide about.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '10 days' + interval '22 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('f95066c8-c9b1-4611-9b4f-21525695082c', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Last big packing push before the movers come. Found cash in an old coat pocket, small win in an otherwise chaotic evening.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '9 days' + interval '20 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('9382f13d-ecbc-4aca-987f-bb70756a7a78', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Everything's in boxes except the bed and a kettle. Slightly terrified about tomorrow. The whole flat move? Feels like it snuck up on me even though I've had two months' warning. Also the Aurora team's launch retro is meant to happen this week too, of course, because nothing in life happens one thing at a time.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '9 days' + interval '23 hours 15 minutes', NULL),
  ('80bde7a5-e953-43ca-b223-2958e2b8c974', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Movers arrived on time, which felt like an actual miracle. Watching strangers carry my sofa down three flights of stairs is a specific kind of stress. Old flat's empty now, weirdly sad saying bye to a place I spent half the last year complaining about.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '8 days' + interval '7 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('cb455fb9-ef54-4ecc-8735-a4cb4fce7da3', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Somehow the Aurora final launch is happening today too, of all days. Spent the mover's lunch break on a work call watching the last cutover metrics come in clean. Devika sent a message just saying 'it's done.' Two exhausting things finishing on the same day should not be allowed by law.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '8 days' + interval '14 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('77b12d24-b623-4243-82e3-49d5eb140f3d', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Collapsed onto a mattress on the floor of the new flat surrounded by boxes I have no energy left to open. Kettle's found, that's the important thing. Everything else can wait until tomorrow, or possibly the weekend, or possibly next month.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '8 days' + interval '22 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('052a413b-e1b0-4b8f-b46e-63301466cc06', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Unpacking day two. Found the kettle's lid, lost the kettle's lid again immediately. There is a box labelled 'misc' that appears to contain the entire contents of a different, smaller flat.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '7 days' + interval '12 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('75d5b4f5-0a76-44c7-9808-e6efe4373931', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Quick call with mum, she's doing fine, in good spirits, made a joke about the scan drama being old news now. Nice to hear her sound completely normal about it. Told her about the new flat, she wants photos.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '7 days' + interval '20 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('57e7bfbe-a0a1-43f6-896b-b98fcecc7d94', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Train down for the wedding. Dress is wrapped in about four layers of protective plastic in a garment bag that took up an entire luggage rack. Knee's fine with all the walking and station stairs, which two months ago I would not have bet on.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '5 days' + interval '9 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('632efc23-d4b3-4579-906a-b0d4588b1469', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Checked into the B&B, tiny but charming, floral wallpaper that belongs in a period drama. Rehearsal dinner prep this afternoon, Priya is somehow both completely calm and vibrating with energy at the same time.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '5 days' + interval '15 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('0d640071-be71-474e-9ffa-88402969c33f', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Rehearsal dinner was lovely, low-key, just close family and the wedding party. Priya's fiancé gave a small toast that had half the table wiping their eyes already, a full day before the actual wedding. Good sign.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '5 days' + interval '23 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('74102f1f-414f-44a9-9128-28512f8ac680', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Wedding day. Woke up early, hair and makeup at nine, the dress fits properly for once instead of needing safety pins like the fitting. Priya is somehow the calmest person in the room, everyone else is a nervous wreck on her behalf.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '4 days' + interval '8 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('22f1319b-4f3b-40b5-988f-de1633bcc56b', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Beautiful day, genuinely one of the best I can remember. The ceremony outside by
the water, Priya's vows made basically everyone cry, mine included, and the
reception ran long in the good way where nobody wants it to end. Danced for hours,
the knee held up completely through all of it, not even a twinge, which after
everything the last two months felt like a small quiet victory of its own tucked
inside a much bigger one.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '4 days' + interval '21 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('c8db57b9-0f70-49f3-8c6f-18ad2add8a41', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Still in my dress, shoes off, sat outside for a minute away from the music. Absolutely knackered. So happy for her.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '4 days' + interval '23 hours 45 minutes', NULL),
  ('940bc414-daad-4e48-a96e-0fbfd7efed39', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Hungover, feet destroyed from the dancing, entirely worth it. Group breakfast at the B&B, everyone reliving last night in fragments.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '3 days' + interval '10 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('debffcfb-1a55-4def-bf08-2a3c9aae4fb0', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Brunch with the other bridesmaids before everyone scatters home. Already planning a reunion trip that will probably never actually happen, in the way these plans never do, but nice to say it anyway.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '3 days' + interval '14 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('7088c373-339a-4865-a32d-9e52b3d4ce06', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Home. Flat still very much mid-move, boxes exactly where I left them like they've been waiting. Too tired to unpack tonight, stepped over a box labelled 'misc' and went straight to bed.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '3 days' + interval '21 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('6598f7e7-0570-4b33-af7e-1c05cc1179b0', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Mountain of laundry from the wedding trip. Wedding photos already trickling into the group chat, Priya looks incredible in all of them, obviously.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '2 days' + interval '11 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('35f42e89-acfc-40e2-9141-a9be1501ead0', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '2 days' + interval '11 hours 5 minutes', date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '2 days' + interval '11 hours 12 minutes'),
  ('172287bb-9a33-4260-ba7f-10bdfd30a389', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Had coffee at 5pm today because the wedding trip and the laundry and the boxes all conspired against the no-caffeine rule. Back on it properly tomorrow. The two months of good sleep have earned themselves a small break, I've decided, unilaterally.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '2 days' + interval '21 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('2d8bd6a4-d49b-46d6-b3f9-cde84549853c', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Good run this morning, proper distance, proper pace, and genuinely no thought about the knee at all until I sat down afterwards and realised I hadn't been thinking about it. That feels like the actual finish line, more than any single run did.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '1 days' + interval '8 hours 15 minutes', NULL),
  ('64926104-9169-45fc-973e-e58836ae55e6', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Finished Lessons in Chemistry on the sofa tonight. Loved it, funnier and sadder than I expected in about equal measure. Already not sure what to read next, might just reread something old for a bit.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '1 days' + interval '20 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('62a6d208-8684-4b0d-83dd-e116f070edd2', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Unpacked the last of the kitchen boxes. Flat finally looks like somewhere a person lives rather than somewhere a person is camping. Quiet, normal evening, first one in a while.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '1 days' + interval '22 hours 30 minutes', NULL),
  ('f91d15a0-31d9-4219-a8f3-b679ce170183', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Grey morning, coffee, nothing urgent on today. Feels strange having a normal unremarkable morning after the last couple of months.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '0 days' + interval '9 hours 0 minutes', NULL),
  ('9537daa5-e71f-4a5c-9bc5-92382d5e0cb0', '5593fa97-b8d8-4a33-a4ce-b967e9b63bfe', $$Quick one at lunch: work fine, knee fine, flat fine. Feels almost suspicious how fine everything currently is.$$, date_trunc('day', now()) - interval '0 days' + interval '13 hours 15 minutes', NULL)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
